@step Declare the natural-person taxpayer type the annual Renta declaration belongs to.
@setup aeat config profile edit docs-sequence-sandbox --quiet --entity-type natural_person
@step Create the Modelo 100 draft the comparison needs.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A
@expect result.modelo == "100"
@expect exit_code == 0
